WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
If you really force employees to transfer their shares at a low price

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,400
Infringement of employee rights

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,800
Just wait for the audit and investigation results

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,400
Don’t rush to convict Director Zhao yet

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
I want to know the true valuation of Luo Yan’s 0.5% shares

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,000
and hotel ownership structure

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Should be subject to independent assessment

8
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,800
The previous 10 million was only an intention put forward by the management

9
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,200
No formal valuation has been completed

10
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,800
Are there any other partners in the hotel?

11
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,000
The remaining shares were previously traded at different prices

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,600
Specifically, time liabilities and operating conditions must be verified.

13
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,600
It cannot be simply calculated based on 40 million per share.

14
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,200
Then hire an independent agency to evaluate

15
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,600
If shareholders are willing to short-circuit the takeover

16
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,800
If you don't want to cooperate, stop here

17
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,000
Zhang Dongzhen has plans to acquire the entire hotel

18
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,600
He's not just venting his anger on behalf of his employees

19
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,400
Instead, it combines equity management and employee rights and interests

20
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,400
It's okay to put it all into the official deal.

21
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,000
I notify other shareholders and the finance team

22
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Do advance adjustments and valuations first

23
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Decide whether to trade

24
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,200
Preliminary assessment is about 5 billion yuan

25
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,600
But the final price will be adjusted based on

26
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,000
Liabilities and shareholder resolutions shall prevail

27
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,200
5 billion yuan is close to the market valuation
